eshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le01ob06e2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le01ob06re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le01ob06e2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le01ob06e2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Hey, come in! How are you? How are the renovations coming along?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I got someone to put in a bay window in the front, but other than that they are happening slowly.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: A bay window! How nice! These house problems seem to be contagious. Now, I'm having a few issues of my own!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're kidding!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Come over here and check this out.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh no! That is a huge stain!\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: The rain is seeping into the house because the shingles on the roof are peeling off."}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le01ob06re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You should have a roofer look at that right away! You will definitely have to get someone to repair it.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yeah. First I thought I might try to look at it more closely myself.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Okay, let's get out the ladder and inspect the roof.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Are you going up the ladder?\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Sure.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Okay, tell me exactly what you see.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I am trying to figure out where this enormous gaping hole came from. Come and take a look."}, {"time": "61000", "image": "engenn9le01ob06re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Okay. Geez. It looks like I have to get a professional to assess what's happening here. In the meantime we are going to the hardware store to get a tarp so the rain can't get in. We'll get Peter to help us put it on the roof.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm afraid I can't stay right now because I'm having Anna cut my hair at 3. I hope you and Peter can manage.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course we can.  With my tool box and Peter's help, we'll know what to do."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Troubles at Home"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Improvised House Repairs"}, {"type": "position", "content": 6}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 1}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe ways of solving problems and getting things done in social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le01ob06re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Present Continuous Tense"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": " The Present Continuous is formed like this:<br/><br/>Subject + the present tense of <span class=\"italic\">to be</span> + (main verb + <span class=\"italic\">ing</span>)<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">I + am +  having</span> a few issues of my own.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/>The Present Continuous"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Subject\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Tense of To  Be\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Main Verb + ing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"am\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"You\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She/ He/ It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"is\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"We\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" having\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"They\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"are\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" having\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "How <span class=\"strong\">are</span> the renovations <span class=\"strong\">coming</span> along?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Now I<span class=\"strong\">'m having</span> a few issues of my own!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The rain <span class=\"strong\">is seeping</span> into the house because the shingles on the roof <span class=\"strong\">are peeling</span> off."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">am trying</span> to figure out where this enormous gaping hole came from."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Are</span> you <span class=\"strong\">going</span> up the ladder?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Causative with have and Get"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the causative with <span class=\"strong\">have</span> and <span class=\"strong\">get</span> to show that you want someone to do something for you.  You cause the person to do something."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Have</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">have</span> + agent + base form of the verb + object"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">should have</span> a roofer <span class=\"strong\">look</span> at that right away!</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<br/><span class=\"underline\">Causative Form with Get</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Subject + <span class=\"italic\">get</span> + agent + infinitive + object"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">You <span class=\"strong\">will definitely have to get</span> someone <span class=\"strong\">to repair</span> it.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you have the agent in the sentence we call it the ACTIVE causative."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">should have</span> a roofer <span class=\"strong\">look</span> at that right away!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "You <span class=\"strong\">will</span> definitely <span class=\"strong\">have to get</span> someone <span class=\"strong\">to repair</span> it."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I <span class=\"strong\">have to get</span> a professional <span class=\"strong\">to assess</span> what's happening here."}, {"type": "example", "content": "We<span class=\"strong\">'ll get</span> Peter <span class=\"strong\">to help</span> us put it on the roof."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm afraid, I can't stay right now because I<span class=\"strong\">'m having</span> Anna <span class=\"strong\">cut</span> my hair at 3. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bay window"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a large window sticking out from an outside wall and forming an alcove of a room"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I got someone to put in a bay window in the front."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you fix a house."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "shingles"}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a roof covering consisting of individual overlapping elements"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The rain is seeping into the house because the shingles on the roof are peeling off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "roof"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the external upper covering of a house or other building"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The rain is seeping into the house because the shingles on the roof are peeling off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to peel off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to separate from a surface"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The shingles on the roof are peeling off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ladder"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a structure of wood, which steps or rungs are set to provide a means of climbing up or down"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Let's get out the ladder and inspect the roof."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "gaping"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a break or opening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am trying to figure out where this enormous gaping hole came from."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "hardware store"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a shop that sells tools for the house or gardening"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going to the hardware store to get a tarp."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tarp"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200blarge \u200bpiece of \u200bwaterproof \u200bcloth or \u200bplastic that is used as a \u200bcover"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are going to get a tarp for the roof."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tool box"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a container to keep the tools "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun) "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: With my tool box and Peter's help, we'll know what to do."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le01ob06aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Describe your dream house to a friend."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Think of its location, the number of rooms it would have and the general decor."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a description of your house with as many details as possible."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Draw out a plan of the house. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about who you would have to help build the house. (I would have a plumber install the pipes, I would have an interior designer ... )"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I describe my dream house."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write a description of my house."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I draw a plan of the house."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about solving the problem of who I would have build the house."}]}]}